source_id":"s-shiji-038-song","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p031","quote":"九年，大司馬孔父嘉妻好，出，道遇太宰華督，督說，目而觀之。督利孔父妻，乃使人宣言國中曰：「殤公即位十年耳，而十一戰，民苦不堪，皆孔父爲之，我且殺孔父以寧民。」是歲，魯弒其君隱公。十年，華督攻殺孔父，取其妻。殤公怒，遂弒殤公，而迎穆公子馮於鄭而立之，是爲莊公。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"穆公子馮","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本篇明示父、子、兄弟、夫人及曾庶孫說；不由繼位補父子，不補母名、共父母或闕代。來源主張與確證史實分開。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji038-015","person_id":"cbr-p001636","title":"穆公","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p028","quote":"宣公有太子與夷。十九年，宣公病，讓其弟和，曰：「父死子繼，兄死弟及，天下通義也。我其立和。」和亦三讓而受之。宣公卒，弟和立，是爲穆公。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji038-015:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p028","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"穆公","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-038-song:m028-0019","usage":"retrospective"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"侯、公及諡號等暫作敘事追稱，不把繼位當當時授予諡號；未知曆日與終點不按卒日補造。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji038-068","person_id":"cbr-p001636","surfaces":["和","我","穆公"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-038-song"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p028","quote":"宣公有太子與夷。十九年，宣公病，讓其弟和，曰：「父死子繼，兄死弟及，天下通義也。我其立和。」和亦三讓而受之。宣公卒，弟和立，是爲穆公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p029","quote":"穆公九年，病，召大司馬孔父謂曰：「先君宣公捨太子與夷而立我，我不敢忘。我死，必立與夷也。」孔父曰：「羣臣皆願立公子馮。」穆公曰：「毋立馮，吾不可以負宣公。」於是穆公使馮出居于鄭。八月庚辰，穆公卒，兄宣公子與夷立，是爲殤公。君子聞之，曰：「宋宣公可謂知人矣，立其弟以成義，然卒其子復享之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p031","quote":"九年，大司馬孔父嘉妻好，出，道遇太宰華督，督說，目而觀之。督利孔父妻，乃使人宣言國中曰：「殤公即位十年耳，而十一戰，民苦不堪，皆孔父爲之，我且殺孔父以寧民。」是歲，魯弒其君隱公。十年，華督攻殺孔父，取其妻。殤公怒，遂弒殤公，而迎穆公子馮於鄭而立之，是爲莊公。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、宋國世系及具體事件暫同指；未把同字短名全域合併，所有引句與未定處保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p028","text":"宣公有太子與夷。十九年，宣公病，讓其弟和，曰：「父死子繼，兄死弟及，天下通義也。我其立和。」和亦三讓而受之。宣公卒，弟和立，是爲穆公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m028-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001634","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m028-0003","start":3,"end":7,"surface":"太子與夷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001635","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m028-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001634","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m028-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"和","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001636","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m028-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"和","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001636","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m028-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"和","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001636","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m028-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"宣公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001634","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m028-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"穆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001636","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","book_id":"b-shiji-038","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p029","text":"穆公九年，病，召大司馬孔父謂曰：「先君宣公捨太子與夷而立我，我不敢忘。我死，必立與夷也。」孔父曰：「羣臣皆願立公子馮。」穆公曰：「毋立馮，吾不可以負宣公。」於是穆公使馮出居于鄭。八月庚辰，穆公卒，兄宣公子與夷立，是爲殤公。君子聞之，曰：「宋宣公可謂知人矣，立其弟以成義，然卒其子復享之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m029-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"穆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001636","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m